                </a>
              </div>

            </div>
          </div>

          <aside class="lg:col-span-4">
            <div class="sticky top-28 space-y-8">
              <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100">
                <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Auf einen Blick</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
                  <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-primary font-bold">→</span> ATEX 2014/34/EU + BetrSichV §6 + TRBS 2152</li>
